-400-lunars/\" target=\"_blank\">400 Lunars</a> but there my partner and I had to come up with, y'know, names and stuff for 400 Lunars and that was a pain.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 1. yoink, i'm stealing that<br /> 2. a hundred kingdoms generator would probably be something i use not just for exalted not gonna lie","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8897-joshopotamus","name":"joshopotamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T20:53:54-08:00","id":1429291,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25834-habitableexoplanet\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25834\" data-vbnamecard=\"25834\">habitableexoplanet</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8897-joshopotamus\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8897_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8897\" data-vbnamecard=\"8897\">joshopotamus</a> I've got the first pass in place. I'm sure there's some tweaking to do, and it doesn't look great yet, but the basics should be there. Take a look and let me know what you think!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://colin-fredericks.github.io/ex3-100-kingdoms/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://colin-fredericks.github.io/ex3-100-k